The non-empty rule: an empty content array fails Validate with RuleMinItems, is not
sent, and is answered -32602 when received; an item passes.
protocol.json states the rules over a schema of its own, shaped like the client
system prompt: an optional instructions object, an open mode enumeration, and an
array of a discriminated block union
(0054-MADR-adopt-acp-schema-1-31-0-and-client-system-prompts.md, D5 and D6).

